  <p>
    As of the current academic session, roughly 100 or more universities hold ODL entitlement and
    around 60 hold online-mode entitlement in India, spanning three broad tiers. This is not an
    endorsement list — verify current entitlement for any specific program yourself before
    enrolling.
  </p>

